brief:
The person tagged the bot in a reply. The post they tagged it in says:
@buildthis.bisks.net a social media site where you can scroll through different software. take me and all my moots posts each day and classify them, see which ones are software. filter out any junk like personal thoughts, politics, ai commentary or debate. we just want the sweet sweet software.

The thread it's replying to, oldest first (this is the context "this" refers to):
@harsimony.bsky.social: With stuff like the Chimera voice, the fruit fly connectome, and people posting minigames, its clear that software objects are becoming memes too. 

Interesting to imagine a social media site where you can scroll through different software.
